864
00:40:43.686 --> 00:40:47.588
Log Kapten, Stardate 47314.5

865
00:40:47.623 --> 00:40:49.648
Kami terus melakukan penelitian kami

866
00:40:49.692 --> 00:40:51.421
Sementara Dewan Federasi

867
